{
  "$comment": [
    "INTERNAL emit leaf. Style setters lower through style_vocab::resolve.",
    "NOT the author language. NOT the docs / LSP / SKILL SSOT.",
    "Author vocabulary is crates/sail/style/src/vocab.rs offered_rows()",
    "(concern | axis | plain). Product attach is tag-position",
    "style({ pad(4).bg(surface), when: { hover: bg(muted) } }).",
    "",
    "This table remains so paint-ops can emit CSS. Do not teach these",
    "utility names as the Style surface.",
    "",
    "  scale:    the value IS a design decision. A token from that scale, and nothing else.",
    "  keywords: the value is physics. The CSS keywords — all of them, no allowlist.",
    "",
    "Several utilities SHARE a name and disambiguate by value. The engine picks",
    "the entry whose value-set contains the value.",
    "",
    "Scales live in Rust (tokens.rs) because they carry the var() templates and are few and",
    "stable. Utilities live here because they are many and grow."
